Value id (.*)
Value name (.*)
Value status (.*)
Value voice (.*)
Value jumbo (.*)

# Parse the output of "show vlan" on an HP AOS-S switch.
#
# Each data line looks like:
#   "  1       DEFAULT_VLAN                     | Port-based No    No"
# The summary lines before the table (Maximum VLANs, Primary VLAN,
# Management VLAN) do not match and are ignored. One record per line.


Start
  ^\s+(?P<id>\d+)\s+(?P<name>[\w-]+)\s+\|\s+(?P<status>[\w-]+)\s+(?P<voice>[\w-]+)\s+(?P<jumbo>[\w-]+)\s*$ -> Record
